open output f2 (already open): 41
open output f2 while f1 open: 61
-- indexed: manual locks, f1 on multiple records
f1 read 01 with lock: 00
f2 read 01: 51
f2 read 01 retry 2 times: 51
f2 read 01 retry for 0.01 seconds: 51
f2 read 01 ignoring lock: 00 [first ]
f2 read 02: 00
f2 read 03 (f1 holds 01 and 03): 51
f2 rewrite 03: 51
f2 delete 03: 51
f2 start 03 (START sees no locks): 00
f1 reads its own locked 01: 00
f1 read 03 with no lock (frees 03 alone): 00
f2 read 03 now: 00
f2 read 01 still: 51
unlock f1: 00
f2 read 01 after unlock: 00
-- indexed: f2 single record, a lock on REWRITE
f1 read 02 (f2 holds it): 51
f2 rewrite 03 with lock: 00
f1 read 02 (f2's rewrite released 02): 00
f1 read 03 (f2's new lock): 51
f1 read 03 (f2's plain read released it): 00
f1 read 01 (f2 closed): 00
-- indexed: automatic
f3 (automatic) read 02: 00
f2 read 02 while f3 holds it: 51
f3 read 01 (single: 02 released): 00
f2 read 02 now: 00
f2 rewrite 01 (f3 holds it): 51
f2 delete 01 (f3 holds it): 51
-- indexed: read only, and a SHARING clause without LOCK MODE
open i-o f1 while f5 read only: 61
open input f1 while f5 read only: 00
f6 (no LOCK MODE) reads f2's locked 01: 00
open i-o f1 while f2 opened SHARING WITH READ ONLY: 61
open input f1 while f2 opened SHARING WITH NO OTHER: 61
